@{ ViewData["Title"] = "開發展示"; }
<section class="showcase-shell">
    <header class="showcase-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> DEVELOPMENT LEDGER · ENGINE 2.86.0</p>
        <h1>讓每一步引擎演進，<em>都有證據可循。</em></h1>
        <p>Aevrynd 是持續演進的 2D／2.5D／3D 遊戲引擎。此頁區分已發布版本、已驗證但未發布切片與歷史產物；技術 gate 通過不等於遊戲畫面達標。</p>
        <div class="truth-strip" aria-label="目前發布狀態">
            <div><small>VISUAL SCORE</small><strong>34 / 100</strong><span class="status-no">NO-GO</span></div>
            <div><small>GAMEPLAY DEMO</small><strong>v1.3.0</strong><span>目前已發布；品質不代表現況目標</span></div>
            <div><small>NEXT RELEASE</small><strong>v1.4</strong><span class="status-no">尚未發布</span></div>
            <div><small>RENDER PATH</small><strong>D3D12</strong><span>跨 Vulkan／Metal 等價尚未證明</span></div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="showcase-section" aria-labelledby="release-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="micro-label">TRACEABLE RELEASES</p><h2 id="release-title">可追溯 Demo 與發布切片</h2><p>只有狀態帳與功能目錄明確附帶版本、來源或驗證契約者列為發布證據。磁碟中的其他舊目錄僅是歷史產物。</p></div>
        <div class="release-grid">
            <article class="release-card release-current"><span>ENGINE LAB</span><h3>v2.55 · 四級陰影</h3><p>4×2048 CSM、contact shadow、113/113 suite；immutable tree 134 files。</p><code>v2.55.0-engine-v2.86.0-c033de38</code></article>
            <article class="release-card"><span>ENGINE LAB</span><h3>v2.53 · Dirty Delta</h3><p>大型世界增量持久化、95/95 tests、GPU validation 8、6 captures。</p><code>v2.53.0-engine-v2.86.0-73f10a96</code></article>
            <article class="release-card"><span>ENGINE LAB</span><h3>v2.52 · Origin Rebase</h3><p>int64 global position 與跨系統 frame-boundary transaction；89/89 tests。</p><code>v2.52.0-engine-v2.86.0-e1584944</code></article>
            <article class="release-card"><span>ENGINE LAB</span><h3>v2.51 · World Partition</h3><p>分區載入驗收切片；81/81 tests、GPU validation 與 5 captures。</p><code>v2.51.0-engine-v2.86.0-4568daa1</code></article>
            <article class="release-card"><span>CHARACTER LAB</span><h3>v2.10 · Character</h3><p>Immutable Character release；latest 與 pinned launcher 完成 12/12 擷取。</p><code>v2.10.0-engine-v2.86.0-27ea58cd</code></article>
            <article class="release-card release-warning"><span>GAMEPLAY LAB</span><h3>v1.3 · 歷史發布</h3><p>目前最新已發布 Gameplay Demo，但已被判定不合格，不可作為目前品質代表。</p><code>v1.3.0-engine-v2.86.0-2260f01e</code></article>
        </div>
        <p class="evidence-note">磁碟另留存 Engine Lab v2.46–2.50／2.54、Gameplay v1.0–1.2 與 Character v2.9.1／其他 v2.10 generations；它們在此僅列為歷史可追溯目錄，不作目前來源通過證據。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="showcase-section" aria-labelledby="timeline-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="micro-label">DEVELOPMENT TIMELINE</p><h2 id="timeline-title">目前已驗證切片</h2></div>
        <div class="timeline">
            <article><time>WORLD</time><h3>World Partition Phase 1／2</h3><p>非同步 prepare／activate／retire、terrain／vegetation payload、origin rebasing 與 Dirty Delta。部分驗收 Demo 已發布，完整大型世界仍持續演進。</p></article>
            <article><time>GPU</time><h3>GPU-driven 1A／1B + HZB</h3><p>compute culling、ExecuteIndirect、homogeneous buckets、current-frame HZB 與 paired benchmark。Temporal hybrid occlusion、bindless indexing仍待完成。</p></article>
            <article><time>LIGHT</time><h3>Forward+ 與四級陰影</h3><p>Forward+ 已提交並驗證；Engine Lab 2.55 已發布 4-cascade CSM 與 contact shadow。這不是 Lumen／Nanite 等價聲明。</p></article>
            <article><time>TEMPORAL</time><h3>TAA previous-depth closure</h3><p>Atmosphere／TAA 同一 sequence token 重用，previous-depth、Color／OID／Depth SHA closure 與 GBV ghost gate 通過；屬核心正確性，不直接提高視覺分數。</p></article>
            <article><time>WORLD DETAIL</time><h3>Water、foliage、Linear HDR</h3><p>逐水體 HDR 合成、透明交錯、葉片 alpha/mip/UV 與 sealed HDR sidecar 已驗證；仍是未發布 WIP。</p></article>
            <article><time>HLOD</time><h3>HLOD Slice 1／2／4</h3><p>Frozen selection、proxy lease、transition raster、HZB identity 與 shadow parity 核心通過。完整 GPU selection、真實 workload 與 gameplay transition pixels 尚缺。</p></article>
            <article><time>POST FX</time><h3>Depth-semantic Bloom</h3><p>最新來源已完成 fresh Normal／GBV 修復驗證；目前仍等待主代理精準提交，不能標示為 production complete。</p></article>
        </div>
    </section>

